WEBVTT

01:40.580 --> 01:44.200
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.080 --> 01:47.150
[Episode 26]

01:47.789 --> 01:50.640
I hope he can use this power wisely

01:50.640 --> 01:52.840
and live out his life

01:52.840 --> 01:54.350
under the protection of Goddess Wushuang

01:54.350 --> 01:55.560
without wasting

01:56.130 --> 01:58.820
the opportunity we've given him.

02:13.280 --> 02:14.710
Why is the sky suddenly so bright?

02:24.430 --> 02:25.240
Ji Tanyin.

02:26.310 --> 02:27.280
Are you going back?

02:28.430 --> 02:29.710
You might be in danger.

02:30.710 --> 02:31.520
I won't.

02:31.590 --> 02:33.150
Do you have to get involved in his affairs?

02:35.220 --> 02:36.850
Excuse me, is Miss Ji here?

02:38.360 --> 02:39.150
That's me.

02:39.260 --> 02:40.950
Someone asked me to deliver this letter to you.

02:56.590 --> 02:57.400
Enjoy.

02:58.710 --> 02:59.680
Miss, welcome.

02:59.800 --> 03:00.590
This way.

03:08.590 --> 03:10.240
If you have something so important

03:10.240 --> 03:11.800
that you must tell me,

03:11.960 --> 03:13.150
now is the time to say it.

03:14.840 --> 03:15.630
The noodles here

03:15.630 --> 03:16.960
don't look that great.

03:17.280 --> 03:18.630
How come you and the High Priest of the Youhu Clan

03:18.630 --> 03:20.280
never get tired of eating them?

03:20.520 --> 03:22.079
I have something important to attend to today.

03:22.150 --> 03:23.310
If you have nothing to say,

03:23.310 --> 03:24.400
I'll be going.

03:27.000 --> 03:27.840
You're upset?

03:28.910 --> 03:29.710
Could it be...

03:30.150 --> 03:31.150
he's seen through you

03:31.400 --> 03:32.710
and known you're up to no good?

03:32.800 --> 03:33.750
What are you talking about?

03:34.430 --> 03:36.360
It can't be. There are plenty of women

03:36.360 --> 03:38.560
skilled in craftsmanship in this world.

03:38.680 --> 03:39.560
Besides me,

03:39.560 --> 03:41.400
who else could have found out

03:41.710 --> 03:43.030
you're Goddess Wushuang?

03:48.840 --> 03:49.910
What are you talking about?

03:51.190 --> 03:52.000
I mean,

03:52.310 --> 03:53.680
sorry, Goddess Wushuang,

03:53.870 --> 03:54.680
you've been…

03:55.680 --> 03:56.440
exposed.

03:57.590 --> 03:58.710
Don't talk nonsense.

03:59.430 --> 04:00.680
Actually, it's not hard to guess.

04:01.280 --> 04:02.400
If anyone

04:02.630 --> 04:04.520
had paid close attention to you,

04:04.690 --> 04:06.180
they'd have noticed you're different.

04:06.840 --> 04:07.630
Look,

04:07.970 --> 04:08.880
you're the Youhu Clan's

04:08.910 --> 04:10.280
High Priest's handmaiden

04:10.680 --> 04:12.470
and a friend to the War Demons.

04:13.120 --> 04:14.800
You're kind to humans as well.

04:15.280 --> 04:16.870
Besides, your craftsmanship is remarkable.

04:17.269 --> 04:19.310
The Youhu Clan, the War Demons, and the human race

04:19.310 --> 04:21.870
have been at odds for over a century,

04:21.870 --> 04:23.480
fighting and spilling blood.

04:23.600 --> 04:25.160
Yet you've managed to deal with them all

04:25.160 --> 04:26.270
and remain neutral.

04:26.600 --> 04:27.630
Isn't that strange?

04:27.800 --> 04:28.510
That's all you have

04:28.510 --> 04:29.870
to determine my identity?

04:30.040 --> 04:30.830
No, no, no.

04:31.430 --> 04:32.310
I don't need all that.

04:32.720 --> 04:34.240
The first time I saw you,

04:34.830 --> 04:36.159
I knew who you were.

04:38.430 --> 04:39.430
900 years ago…

04:40.830 --> 04:42.310
you made a lamp.

04:43.480 --> 04:44.600
Do you remember?

04:48.040 --> 04:49.159
You're a weapon spirit?

04:51.190 --> 04:52.000
Yes.

04:56.000 --> 04:57.190
I've been around

04:57.240 --> 04:58.270
for quite a while.

04:59.310 --> 05:00.680
I thought in this lifetime,

05:00.950 --> 05:01.800
I'd never have the chance

05:01.800 --> 05:03.070
to see you again.

05:03.950 --> 05:05.070
I didn't expect that lamp

05:05.070 --> 05:07.310
to create a weapon spirit.

05:07.560 --> 05:08.310
I thought it had been

05:08.310 --> 05:10.270
destroyed in the war between gods and demons.

05:10.870 --> 05:11.680
Indeed.

05:12.240 --> 05:13.160
This world

05:13.430 --> 05:15.000
is full of unexpected things,

05:15.150 --> 05:16.560
and that's what makes it so fascinating.

05:17.270 --> 05:18.240
Goddess Wushuang,

05:18.830 --> 05:20.120
during those years when I was a lamp,

05:20.120 --> 05:21.240
I kept watching you

05:21.780 --> 05:22.830
and kept wondering

05:23.120 --> 05:24.360
what kind of man

05:24.360 --> 05:25.480
you'd fall for.

05:26.190 --> 05:28.360
Would it be someone like Deity Taihe,

05:28.360 --> 05:30.680
serious and dignified?

05:30.870 --> 05:32.800
Or someone like Mr. Loong, humorous

05:33.430 --> 05:34.630
and knowledgeable?

05:34.870 --> 05:36.240
Thinking it over,

05:36.750 --> 05:38.360
I figured it should be a combination of both.

05:38.360 --> 05:39.159
In other words...

05:41.560 --> 05:42.560
it should be someone like me.

05:43.240 --> 05:44.159
But who would have thought

05:44.430 --> 05:45.480
you'd fall for someone

05:45.480 --> 05:47.560
like the High Priest of the Youhu Clan?

05:50.040 --> 05:52.480
You came to kill him and take his hand, right?

05:53.600 --> 05:55.000
Indulging yourself like this,

05:55.600 --> 05:56.390
aren't you afraid

05:57.310 --> 05:58.510
of being caught in a dilemma

05:58.630 --> 06:00.070
and putting yourself in a difficult position?

06:00.070 --> 06:01.360
It's not what you think.

06:01.360 --> 06:02.630
You can't hide it.

06:03.000 --> 06:05.000
The Divine Left Hand, created by you,

06:05.000 --> 06:06.310
is now on him.

06:06.430 --> 06:08.430
It's obvious why you're here.

06:08.870 --> 06:10.680
I'm just worried about you,

06:10.680 --> 06:11.920
and I feel sorry for him.

06:12.870 --> 06:13.680
So tell me,

06:13.950 --> 06:15.000
if one day

06:15.360 --> 06:17.040
he learns who you are

06:17.040 --> 06:18.070
and why you came,

06:18.750 --> 06:20.560
how do you think he'll feel?

06:20.600 --> 06:21.680
He won't find out.

06:24.240 --> 06:25.510
Is this why

06:25.510 --> 06:26.950
you called me here today?

06:27.680 --> 06:28.720
No, no, no.

06:33.680 --> 06:34.560
Goddess Wushuang,

06:35.000 --> 06:36.070
I exist because of you,

06:37.040 --> 06:38.390
so I owe you my life.

06:39.360 --> 06:40.600
There's something

06:40.600 --> 06:41.600
I've kept buried in my heart.

06:41.830 --> 06:43.070
It's a secret of great importance.

06:43.240 --> 06:44.360
If anything goes wrong,

06:45.270 --> 06:46.600
it could lead to the collapse of heaven and earth

06:46.870 --> 06:48.270
and the destruction of the Six Realms.

06:48.720 --> 06:49.510
Now,

06:50.600 --> 06:51.680
I want to tell you about it.

06:58.159 --> 07:00.830
During the war between gods and demons, I saw with my own eyes

07:02.160 --> 07:04.040
that Deity Taihe was the Demon God.

07:07.850 --> 07:09.200
When I discovered this,

07:09.720 --> 07:11.350
I fled to the mortal realm in a panic.

07:12.630 --> 07:13.600
Since then,

07:14.920 --> 07:16.510
I've never mentioned it to anyone.

07:18.310 --> 07:19.630
I'd never lie to you.

07:23.430 --> 07:24.920
Thank you for telling me this.

07:29.510 --> 07:30.390
Fu Jiuyun.

07:32.040 --> 07:33.070
As a weapon spirit,

07:33.070 --> 07:34.159
you're one in a million

07:34.680 --> 07:35.870
and have lived among mortals for a long time.

07:36.240 --> 07:37.720
In the mortal realm,

07:37.720 --> 07:38.830
through ups and downs,

07:39.430 --> 07:41.070
you've already carved your own path.

07:41.720 --> 07:43.120
I can see that your sea of consciousness

07:43.430 --> 07:44.680
is shrouded in fog.

07:45.070 --> 07:46.720
You've forgotten the most important thing.

07:47.830 --> 07:50.159
Your path is not in the Divine Realm,

07:50.720 --> 07:51.750
nor is it with me.

07:53.390 --> 07:55.040
Let me clear the fog for you

07:55.350 --> 07:56.480
so you can see your way forward.

08:09.720 --> 08:10.510
Go now.

08:11.150 --> 08:12.440
We'll meet again someday.

08:52.480 --> 08:54.540
[Yandu City]

08:59.750 --> 09:01.910
Why is the sky suddenly so bright?

09:02.030 --> 09:03.600
Is it an omen of natural disasters?

09:04.150 --> 09:05.620
Steamed buns!

09:05.720 --> 09:07.200
Freshly steamed buns!

09:07.200 --> 09:09.000
Thin skin, big filling, piping hot.

09:09.030 --> 09:10.270
Sir, have some buns.

09:10.270 --> 09:12.200
Mom, I want some buns.

09:13.480 --> 09:14.940
Now you know it hurts!

09:15.320 --> 09:15.910
It hurts.

09:15.910 --> 09:17.480
Do you still know who I am?

09:17.500 --> 09:18.410
You've been out for three days,

09:18.440 --> 09:19.870
gambling day and night.

09:19.870 --> 09:21.000
How much did you lose this time?

09:21.000 --> 09:22.080
I won this time.

09:22.480 --> 09:25.440
Amazing! Amazing!

09:25.750 --> 09:27.550
All talk and no action is fake skill.

09:27.550 --> 09:29.360
All action and no talk is dumb skill.

09:29.360 --> 09:31.720
Talking and doing—that's real skill!

09:31.740 --> 09:33.390
My father and I just arrived here.

09:33.390 --> 09:34.670
We don't know anyone or anything about this place.

09:34.910 --> 09:36.080
We need money to continue our travel.

09:36.080 --> 09:37.480
If you can spare a little change, we'd be grateful.

09:37.480 --> 09:38.270
Sir, we just got

09:38.270 --> 09:39.000
some new calligraphy works and paintings.

09:39.000 --> 09:39.840
Are you interested?

09:39.870 --> 09:40.750
Would you like to take a look?

09:42.000 --> 09:43.120
Would you like to buy calligraphy works or paintings?

09:43.480 --> 09:44.390
No, I can't afford them.

09:44.390 --> 09:45.790
Sir, sir.

09:46.670 --> 09:48.320
Sir, please help me out.

09:48.320 --> 09:49.270
I'm a poor little cripple.

09:49.270 --> 09:50.240
Please show some pity

09:50.240 --> 09:51.510
and give me a copper coin.

09:51.910 --> 09:53.750
Sir, I haven't eaten for a long time.

09:53.750 --> 09:55.270
Please help me out.

09:59.870 --> 10:01.030
You have a death wish?

10:01.030 --> 10:02.120
How dare you hit me!

10:24.480 --> 10:25.870
Sir, this is the place.

10:26.760 --> 10:27.370
Here you are.

10:28.070 --> 10:28.650
Have a seat.

10:31.510 --> 10:33.200
I thought you wouldn't come.

10:34.080 --> 10:34.960
You're buying me a meal.

10:34.960 --> 10:36.030
How could I not come?

10:36.960 --> 10:38.600
You like peace and quiet,

10:38.600 --> 10:39.750
so I thought you might find this place too noisy.

10:40.630 --> 10:41.840
Here, let's drink.

10:49.790 --> 10:50.600
This wine

10:51.080 --> 10:51.770
is a bit bland.

10:52.840 --> 10:54.000
I don't like it either.

10:55.320 --> 10:56.910
Then why did you order a whole jar of it?

10:58.670 --> 10:59.790
Parting ways with my friend,

10:59.790 --> 11:01.380
I can't help but feel a little down.

11:01.750 --> 11:03.260
You're a really good friend.

11:03.440 --> 11:04.870
Though the wine's not so good,

11:05.030 --> 11:07.550
it can still lessen the sorrow a bit.

11:08.110 --> 11:08.910
You're leaving?

11:09.630 --> 11:10.550
Back to Baitou Mountain.

11:10.750 --> 11:12.000
Didn't you just leave that place?

11:12.240 --> 11:13.480
I did.

11:14.360 --> 11:15.150
Let me tell you,

11:15.290 --> 11:15.790
when I was alone

11:15.790 --> 11:16.710
back in Baitou Mountain,

11:16.840 --> 11:17.870
I felt so bored.

11:17.960 --> 11:20.600
I heard Yandu City is bustling and prosperous,

11:20.600 --> 11:21.670
so I came to take a look.

11:21.840 --> 11:22.720
But after coming here,

11:23.030 --> 11:24.440
I found it just so-so.

11:25.270 --> 11:26.360
Everyone's

11:26.600 --> 11:27.670
obsessed with fame and fortune.

11:28.000 --> 11:29.120
If this is the mortal world,

11:30.030 --> 11:31.550
it's not worth staying for.

11:33.440 --> 11:34.440
Sounds like

11:34.600 --> 11:35.730
you've found your way to enlightenment.

11:38.240 --> 11:39.330
Stop flattering me.

11:39.960 --> 11:41.030
If we're talking about enlightenment,

11:41.510 --> 11:43.270
you had the courage to cut off the Five Sins.

11:43.630 --> 11:45.330
I could never manage that.

11:56.240 --> 11:57.080
Yuanzhong,

11:58.240 --> 11:59.120
in a blink of an eye,

11:59.630 --> 12:00.440
we've known each other

12:00.440 --> 12:01.720
for 60 years, right?

12:03.630 --> 12:04.440
Almost.

12:06.120 --> 12:07.510
How time flies.

12:10.200 --> 12:10.870
Do you remember

12:10.870 --> 12:12.200
when we first met?

12:12.200 --> 12:13.440
You smashed my cave dwelling,

12:13.440 --> 12:14.480
and I went to you angrily

12:14.480 --> 12:15.790
to demand an explanation.

12:17.150 --> 12:17.910
At that time,

12:17.910 --> 12:19.510
you had just defeated the War Demons

12:19.510 --> 12:21.600
and were so powerful with the Divine Left Hand.

12:21.840 --> 12:24.030
You were riding high on success.

12:25.360 --> 12:26.200
Let me tell you,

12:26.200 --> 12:27.270
before I met you,

12:27.270 --> 12:27.910
I made

12:27.910 --> 12:29.150
a lot of preparations.

12:29.150 --> 12:30.600
I thought there'd be

12:30.600 --> 12:32.270
a fierce battle between us for sure.

12:32.470 --> 12:33.440
But unexpectedly,

12:33.480 --> 12:34.270
when we met,

12:34.270 --> 12:36.410
you just handed me a chest full of gold.

12:36.430 --> 12:38.240
It was a big chest of gold.

12:38.480 --> 12:39.240
You have no idea.

12:39.240 --> 12:40.600
I was completely dumbfounded.

12:40.600 --> 12:42.020
I'd never seen that much gold in my life.

12:44.030 --> 12:44.840
As a cultivator

12:44.840 --> 12:46.360
who's about to ascend,

12:46.630 --> 12:47.440
why do you still care so much

12:47.440 --> 12:48.440
about money?

12:49.320 --> 12:50.240
What's wrong with that?

12:50.240 --> 12:51.960
Even immortals have to eat!

12:53.140 --> 12:53.810
Someone like you,

12:53.840 --> 12:54.910
who once lived in wealth and luxury,

12:54.980 --> 12:56.070
wouldn't understand.

12:58.960 --> 12:59.750
Actually,

13:01.030 --> 13:02.670
I was injured at that time.

13:03.270 --> 13:04.600
I was worried I couldn't beat you,

13:04.620 --> 13:07.270
so I resorted to that trick.

13:12.320 --> 13:13.720
Is... is that so?

13:16.230 --> 13:17.510
At that time, I just thought

13:17.720 --> 13:19.630
the High Priest of the Youhu Clan

13:19.630 --> 13:20.890
looked pretty intimidating,

13:21.180 --> 13:22.430
but he was actually reasonable—

13:22.600 --> 13:23.480
someone worth befriending.

13:23.960 --> 13:24.750
So?

13:25.440 --> 13:26.750
So when you asked me later

13:26.750 --> 13:28.030
to watch over Kai Shan,

13:28.030 --> 13:29.200
I agreed.

13:34.440 --> 13:35.550
When I was young,

13:36.150 --> 13:37.150
I was obsessed with martial arts,

13:37.510 --> 13:39.440
devoted to training and cultivation.

13:40.080 --> 13:41.550
When the War Demons and the Youhu Clan

13:41.550 --> 13:42.550
went to war,

13:42.720 --> 13:43.750
I was training.

13:44.000 --> 13:46.120
When the war reached humans,

13:46.120 --> 13:47.600
I was still training.

13:48.080 --> 13:49.080
If you hadn't shattered my cave

13:49.080 --> 13:50.390
with one strike,

13:50.480 --> 13:53.270
I probably would've kept training until my tribulation arrived.

13:56.210 --> 13:57.330
That's not wrong.

14:03.200 --> 14:04.030
Not wrong?

14:05.200 --> 14:06.380
It's completely wrong!

14:07.360 --> 14:08.650
I gained all those skills,

14:08.840 --> 14:10.480
yet all I ever thought about was myself.

14:11.150 --> 14:12.150
I went down

14:12.630 --> 14:13.840
the wrong path.

14:15.670 --> 14:17.240
Sometimes I even think

14:17.750 --> 14:19.480
that perhaps these endless tribulations

14:20.200 --> 14:21.960
have nothing to do with the broken

14:22.150 --> 14:23.320
celestial ladder.

14:23.670 --> 14:25.510
This is the heavenly way's punishment for me—

14:25.670 --> 14:27.630
punishment for my selfishness

14:27.720 --> 14:29.390
and for turning a blind eye to others.

14:31.960 --> 14:34.390
Sounds like you're hinting at something.

14:37.200 --> 14:38.960
Am I? No, I'm not.

14:41.480 --> 14:43.600
This restaurant has neither famous dishes nor renowned wines,

14:44.080 --> 14:45.360
but on my way here,

14:45.390 --> 14:47.000
I caught glimpses of the worldly life.

14:47.320 --> 14:48.120
I guess

14:48.440 --> 14:49.630
this is the real reason

14:49.630 --> 14:50.750
you chose this place to say goodbye.

14:51.480 --> 14:52.720
What do you want to tell me?

14:56.720 --> 14:58.030
You know everything, don't you?

15:03.200 --> 15:04.000
Yeah.

15:04.960 --> 15:05.750
Of course,

15:05.840 --> 15:07.030
if I were you

15:07.030 --> 15:08.200
and had gone through all those things,

15:08.240 --> 15:09.630
I'd probably have lost it long ago

15:09.630 --> 15:11.600
and slaughtered my way through this wretched world.

15:12.080 --> 15:13.200
So what right do I have

15:13.200 --> 15:14.240
to talk you out of it?

15:16.100 --> 15:17.140
But, Yuanzhong,

15:17.550 --> 15:18.880
even though I have no right,

15:19.220 --> 15:20.260
there's one thing

15:20.480 --> 15:21.910
I must ask.

15:26.660 --> 15:27.900
Do you really have to do this?

15:28.510 --> 15:29.320
Are there

15:29.590 --> 15:31.220
really no other options?

15:50.150 --> 15:50.960
I'm leaving.

15:52.750 --> 15:53.720
Let's part ways here.

15:56.440 --> 15:57.240
Mei Shan.

16:00.630 --> 16:01.440
Say no more.

16:01.840 --> 16:02.630
I drank too fast.

16:03.000 --> 16:04.590
That's enough wine for today.

16:05.200 --> 16:06.480
While it's still light out,

16:06.750 --> 16:07.790
I should get going.

16:12.200 --> 16:13.000
Yuanzhong,

16:14.000 --> 16:15.550
no matter what choice you make,

16:16.320 --> 16:17.260
I'll stand by you.

16:19.240 --> 16:20.150
Without good wine,

16:21.560 --> 16:22.970
we're still good friends.

17:32.680 --> 17:33.480
Qian Lin!

17:34.400 --> 17:35.110
What's wrong?

17:35.110 --> 17:36.350
Tanyin has no breath.

17:36.350 --> 17:37.790
Go get a doctor!

17:37.790 --> 17:39.110
Go!

18:41.200 --> 18:42.000
Stop right there.

18:42.270 --> 18:43.070
Hannv.

18:45.180 --> 18:46.820
You don't greet me now

18:46.870 --> 18:48.660
and don't see me as your friend anymore.

18:49.490 --> 18:50.290
Where are you going?

18:50.320 --> 18:51.760
Why should I tell you?

18:56.270 --> 18:57.550
I haven't even confronted you

18:57.550 --> 18:58.590
about ordering the War Demons

18:58.590 --> 19:00.310
to cast the Descent Spell on me.

19:00.310 --> 19:01.680
You'd better

19:01.680 --> 19:02.880
get out of my way.

19:03.000 --> 19:04.440
How arrogant.

19:47.570 --> 19:48.370
Yuanzhong.

19:52.350 --> 19:54.390
Duanfeng Mountain, the coldest place in the world.

19:54.600 --> 19:56.400
Yuanzhong, it's time.

19:56.430 --> 19:58.220
Yuanzhong, I've arrived.

19:58.400 --> 19:59.270
I've arrived too.

19:59.750 --> 20:00.590
Wunian Cliff,

20:00.820 --> 20:01.940
the extremity of the world.

20:02.470 --> 20:03.680
With this cliff as the altar,

20:04.310 --> 20:06.510
may all jealousy and evil thoughts be purged.

20:06.510 --> 20:08.590
With the destruction of the source of greed and power,

20:08.720 --> 20:10.440
may the ignorant and greedy souls

20:10.550 --> 20:11.750
find salvation soon.

20:12.080 --> 20:12.880
Hypocrisy.

20:12.900 --> 20:13.690
Obsession.

20:13.720 --> 20:14.570
Cruelty.

20:14.880 --> 20:15.680
Jealousy.

20:15.750 --> 20:16.550
Ignorance.

20:16.830 --> 20:18.590
Now, the five of us join forces,

20:18.640 --> 20:20.030
offering our lives as fuel

20:20.200 --> 20:22.550
and burning our souls to cleanse the world's sins.

20:22.790 --> 20:23.590
No regrets.

20:23.680 --> 20:24.480
No resentment.

20:26.200 --> 20:27.030
No regrets.

20:27.900 --> 20:28.690
No resentment.

20:30.700 --> 20:31.590
Well said.

20:32.450 --> 20:33.900
But you miscounted.

20:34.790 --> 20:36.400
It's not five people to be sacrificed.

20:37.220 --> 20:38.190
It's six.

20:40.880 --> 20:41.920
You all stand ready.

20:44.960 --> 20:46.810
I need to settle one last matter.

20:48.880 --> 20:49.680
You're getting

20:49.700 --> 20:50.900
bolder and bolder,

20:51.270 --> 20:52.480
not only showing me disrespect

20:52.480 --> 20:54.550
but having no concern for Deity Taihe as well.

20:54.830 --> 20:56.160
Looks like you don't want

20:56.350 --> 20:57.350
your divine title anymore.

20:57.350 --> 20:58.720
I can't make you understand.

21:01.480 --> 21:02.400
What are you doing?

21:02.640 --> 21:04.000
You're too selfish.

21:04.240 --> 21:05.330
Just because you like Yuanzhong,

21:05.550 --> 21:06.880
you don't care about Taihe

21:06.900 --> 21:08.280
or the Divine Realm anymore.

21:08.720 --> 21:09.550
I won't allow you

21:09.550 --> 21:11.000
to act so recklessly.

21:11.000 --> 21:12.550
As for why I need Yuanzhong alive,

21:12.550 --> 21:13.240
in the Discipline Hall,

21:13.240 --> 21:14.550
I explained everything clearly,

21:14.680 --> 21:16.200
and I've told you more than once.

21:16.330 --> 21:17.890
I won't repeat what I've already said.

21:17.960 --> 21:19.170
I have something important

21:19.190 --> 21:20.360
to report to the five divine lords.

21:20.480 --> 21:21.810
It concerns Deity Taihe.

21:22.070 --> 21:23.240
Don't get in my way.

22:09.830 --> 22:11.550
Your words might fool

22:11.550 --> 22:13.210
the five divine lords in the Discipline Hall,

22:13.290 --> 22:14.090
but not me.

22:14.820 --> 22:15.770
Do you dare to swear

22:15.830 --> 22:17.000
that all your actions today

22:17.000 --> 22:18.160
have no personal motives?

22:18.160 --> 22:19.440
Do you dare to swear that you have

22:19.440 --> 22:20.750
no feelings for Yuanzhong at all?

22:20.910 --> 22:22.430
I don't need to explain myself to you.

22:22.680 --> 22:23.640
You don't need to?

22:23.720 --> 22:25.110
You just don't dare to.

22:43.640 --> 22:44.710
Your Divinity, can you hear me?

22:46.640 --> 22:47.440
Your Divinity,

22:48.790 --> 22:50.270
I don't know what kind of god you are,

22:51.750 --> 22:53.360
so I'll just call you that for now.

22:54.310 --> 22:55.400
Years have passed.

22:55.750 --> 22:57.160
It's been a long time

22:57.750 --> 22:59.320
since I last spoke to you.

22:59.790 --> 23:01.720
I used to talk to you all the time.

23:03.140 --> 23:04.100
Do you remember?

23:09.550 --> 23:10.750
I was young then,

23:12.380 --> 23:14.050
and I always seemed to have so much to say.

23:14.350 --> 23:15.590
I talked about my dreams,

23:16.030 --> 23:17.360
my life,

23:18.430 --> 23:19.360
and myself.

23:20.920 --> 23:21.720
Later,

23:22.590 --> 23:24.720
I went through a lot of things—

23:26.940 --> 23:27.840
doubt,

23:27.010 --> 23:29.150
♫Time never defeats the fleeting world♫

23:28.660 --> 23:29.500
betrayal,

23:30.030 --> 23:32.550
♫Stars turn, shining upon the passing traveler♫

23:30.510 --> 23:31.350
the loss of my home,

23:32.720 --> 23:33.510
and the deaths of my loved ones.

23:34.400 --> 23:35.360
Gradually…

23:34.460 --> 23:37.150
♫The wind rises, flowers fall and bloom again♫

23:37.420 --> 23:40.580
♫Awaiting what's lost to be regained♫

23:37.810 --> 23:39.240
I just stopped talking.

23:41.580 --> 23:43.850
♫These countless sorrows and joys♫

23:42.590 --> 23:44.030
For 60 years in Fangwai Mountain,

23:44.570 --> 23:48.870
♫Dusk and dawn, only you make parting hard♫

23:45.440 --> 23:47.200
I kept thinking about one question.

23:49.010 --> 23:55.570
♫I'm willing to risk my life for this♫

23:49.270 --> 23:50.160
I wondered…

23:51.750 --> 23:53.160
was I wrong?

23:53.720 --> 23:55.440
Was I wrong from the very start?

23:55.700 --> 23:58.150
♫Wind chimes beat with my heart♫

23:57.270 --> 23:58.680
Perhaps the Youhu Clan

23:58.680 --> 24:00.200
was never worth saving.

23:58.890 --> 24:01.920
♫Harmonizing, can you recognize it?♫

24:01.110 --> 24:02.440
This chaotic world

24:03.200 --> 24:04.440
might have had its own destiny,

24:03.270 --> 24:06.140
♫Fingertips tracing your outline♫

24:04.790 --> 24:06.070
and there was no need for me to intervene

24:06.070 --> 24:07.960
with the power of the Divine Hand.

24:06.550 --> 24:09.280
♫I wish to see through you♫

24:08.920 --> 24:09.720
Maybe

24:10.550 --> 24:13.270
♫Whether near or far♫

24:12.510 --> 24:14.600
this is the ending the Mortal Realm should have.

24:14.120 --> 24:18.280
♫We can still gaze upon the same galaxy♫

24:16.750 --> 24:18.400
I kept this half of the jade token

24:18.960 --> 24:23.840
♫Knowing we've never been apart for a moment♫

24:19.040 --> 24:20.720
to seek protection.

24:22.310 --> 24:23.200
But as time passed,

24:24.480 --> 24:26.400
my hands became stained with blood.

24:25.190 --> 24:28.060
♫If our promise♫

24:27.090 --> 24:28.810
I felt unworthy to speak freely with you,

24:28.080 --> 24:32.370
♫Is to share this land and rivers♫

24:29.720 --> 24:31.310
even less worthy of your protection.

24:31.680 --> 24:32.640
Gradually,

24:32.560 --> 24:35.260
♫If fate leads us astray♫

24:34.000 --> 24:34.790
it became

24:34.790 --> 24:36.030
a reminder for me—

24:35.650 --> 24:39.330
♫Life and death become our bond♫

24:36.590 --> 24:37.720
a reminder that

24:37.790 --> 24:38.790
there was once a time

24:38.790 --> 24:40.640
when my hands were clean.

24:39.730 --> 24:42.450
♫Storms heal with time♫

24:41.960 --> 24:42.720
I never expected

24:42.720 --> 24:44.110
that in this final moment,

24:42.920 --> 24:47.740
♫Memories will shine in the end♫

24:45.510 --> 24:47.030
the only one I could confide in…

24:47.770 --> 24:53.130
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

24:50.360 --> 24:51.640
would be you.

24:53.970 --> 24:54.770
Your Divinity,

24:55.050 --> 25:01.670
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

24:56.310 --> 24:57.440
I once saw you.

24:58.750 --> 25:00.270
I know you exist.

25:00.590 --> 25:02.160
But if gods exist,

25:02.310 --> 25:04.240
why have they abandoned the Mortal Realm?

25:04.510 --> 25:05.830
If you exist,

25:06.160 --> 25:06.880
why won't you

25:06.880 --> 25:08.240
come to see me?

25:08.750 --> 25:09.750
Is it because the Mortal Realm

25:09.750 --> 25:11.030
isn't worthy of your protection?

25:13.070 --> 25:15.240
Or is it because I'm not worthy of your forgiveness?

25:16.960 --> 25:17.670
Oh no.

25:59.270 --> 26:00.680
I underestimated you.

26:01.880 --> 26:03.400
Sometimes I even wonder

26:04.260 --> 26:06.100
where you came from

26:06.720 --> 26:08.200
and how you managed to give

26:08.200 --> 26:09.680
this half of the jade token to me.

26:10.220 --> 26:11.550
When you gave it out,

26:12.680 --> 26:14.570
you must have had many expectations.

26:15.310 --> 26:16.200
I don't know if you can

26:16.200 --> 26:17.550
see me now,

26:18.880 --> 26:20.270
or if you can hear me.

26:21.080 --> 26:21.880
I even…

26:23.720 --> 26:24.750
I even wonder

26:26.510 --> 26:28.200
if you're disappointed in me.

26:46.850 --> 26:47.650
Your Divinity,

26:48.850 --> 26:50.170
can you hear me?

26:55.110 --> 26:56.000
Let me go!

26:56.400 --> 26:57.200
Your Divinity,

26:57.660 --> 26:59.210
I really hope you can hear me.

27:00.170 --> 27:01.810
People call me a god,

27:02.880 --> 27:04.350
but they've all forgotten

27:05.240 --> 27:06.270
this "god" they speak of

27:06.750 --> 27:07.880
is merely relying on

27:07.880 --> 27:09.310
the power of the Divine Hand.

27:11.270 --> 27:12.560
Without this hand,

27:14.400 --> 27:15.710
what am I?

27:18.880 --> 27:19.750
The Youhu Clan

27:19.750 --> 27:22.110
is seen as an immortal clan by the world,

27:23.030 --> 27:25.160
and they really think they're gods.

27:26.240 --> 27:27.550
I'm not that foolish.

27:28.640 --> 27:29.720
Purging the Five Sins

27:30.310 --> 27:31.480
and ascending to godhood

27:32.030 --> 27:34.160
is a beautiful dream Dingxu wove for me.

27:35.510 --> 27:36.990
But it's not my dream.

27:38.070 --> 27:39.000
The only dream I ever had

27:39.000 --> 27:40.310
since I was little

27:41.200 --> 27:43.200
was to return home victorious

27:44.200 --> 27:46.720
and have a bowl of hot porridge

27:47.240 --> 27:48.880
brought to me by my parents and sister.

27:49.680 --> 27:50.640
But now,

27:52.110 --> 27:54.070
they've been gone for 60 years.

27:56.880 --> 27:57.960
And my dream

28:00.240 --> 28:02.110
has been gone for 60 years too.

28:02.750 --> 28:03.880
60 years ago,

28:04.850 --> 28:07.000
the world punished me for the Five Sins.

28:07.640 --> 28:08.960
So today,

28:09.110 --> 28:11.400
I'll punish the world for the Five Sins.

28:12.090 --> 28:13.370
Look at the Mortal Realm.

28:14.290 --> 28:15.680
Wickedness thrives;

28:15.920 --> 28:17.240
evil desires run rampant.

28:18.680 --> 28:19.480
The Five Sins

28:20.200 --> 28:22.590
are nothing but a big lie.

28:24.030 --> 28:25.550
I want to see

28:25.970 --> 28:27.380
how many people

28:27.990 --> 28:29.750
can truly live without sin

28:30.240 --> 28:31.750
in the vast Mortal Realm.

28:32.030 --> 28:32.830
No!

28:33.350 --> 28:34.400
Don't do that!

28:35.030 --> 28:36.440
60 years ago,

28:36.930 --> 28:39.170
I became numb to bloodshed.

28:39.990 --> 28:41.320
Hundreds of thousands of War Demons

28:41.350 --> 28:42.060
died before me

28:42.080 --> 28:43.850
like ants,

28:44.750 --> 28:46.790
and I didn't even blink.

28:47.310 --> 28:48.110
This time,

28:48.750 --> 28:49.790
it's just another number,

28:49.790 --> 28:51.920
only bigger than before.

28:52.190 --> 28:54.400
I once spared lives,

28:55.330 --> 28:57.000
but today, I'll reclaim them

28:57.390 --> 28:59.630
and a thousand times more!

29:00.040 --> 29:01.030
Let me go!

29:02.790 --> 29:04.310
Gods above,

29:04.700 --> 29:06.060
heavens above,

29:06.470 --> 29:07.950
I, Yuanzhong of the Youhu Clan,

29:08.160 --> 29:10.110
offer my divine power

29:10.130 --> 29:11.800
and my life as sacrifices

29:11.830 --> 29:13.640
to cleanse this world of desires

29:14.780 --> 29:16.500
and seek justice

29:16.520 --> 29:18.280
from this false, hypocritical,

29:18.550 --> 29:19.960
and self-righteous world!

29:22.290 --> 29:23.860
No. Stop!

29:24.790 --> 29:25.790
I must go find him.

29:25.920 --> 29:26.720
Find who?

29:28.270 --> 29:29.240
Stop struggling.

29:29.310 --> 29:30.550
I don't want to hurt you.

29:30.880 --> 29:32.400
Do you think I'd still believe you?

29:32.460 --> 29:33.270
Do you really want to

29:33.270 --> 29:34.510
fight me to the bitter end?

29:34.510 --> 29:35.270
Just take the Divine Hand

29:35.270 --> 29:36.270
and focus on your craftsmanship.

29:36.270 --> 29:37.070
Isn't that a better choice?

29:37.310 --> 29:38.640
As a goddess, I have duties—

29:38.670 --> 29:40.320
not just to pass down the art of craftsmanship,

29:40.400 --> 29:41.920
but to ensure the good are rewarded

29:41.920 --> 29:43.400
and the wicked pay the price.

29:44.000 --> 29:44.960
That's something

29:44.980 --> 29:46.500
you'll never understand!

29:59.790 --> 30:00.750
What a pity.

30:02.700 --> 30:05.790
A mortal heart is still just a mortal heart.

30:06.750 --> 30:08.200
Even now,

30:09.270 --> 30:11.350
I still can't let go.

30:12.130 --> 30:13.040
There's someone

30:14.940 --> 30:16.450
I can't get over.

30:17.310 --> 30:18.550
I miss

30:19.190 --> 30:20.840
those days I spent with her

30:20.860 --> 30:22.140
in the Mortal Realm.

30:23.010 --> 30:24.170
For decades,

30:25.830 --> 30:27.400
she was the only one

30:28.710 --> 30:30.840
who nearly swayed my resolve.

30:33.400 --> 30:34.590
She made me hesitate,

30:35.860 --> 30:36.740
have doubts,

30:39.200 --> 30:41.090
and even question myself.

30:44.640 --> 30:45.440
But thankfully...

30:49.270 --> 30:51.310
Thankfully, everything between her and me

30:53.030 --> 30:54.880
was just my own wishful thinking.

31:01.550 --> 31:03.350
Even if I'm gone,

31:04.920 --> 31:05.720
I suppose

31:07.310 --> 31:09.270
she wouldn't grieve for too long.

31:11.580 --> 31:13.050
Ji Tanyin, stop!

31:13.880 --> 31:15.010
You won't make it.

31:17.000 --> 31:17.790
You're injured

31:17.790 --> 31:19.200
and can't use your divine power in the Mortal Realm.

31:19.200 --> 31:20.310
You won't make it!

31:20.310 --> 31:22.070
Yuanzhong, wait for me.

31:23.530 --> 31:25.720
No birth and no death.

31:26.750 --> 31:29.200
No dwelling and no emptiness.

31:30.180 --> 31:31.910
No law and no absence of law.

31:32.680 --> 31:34.750
No ignorance and no absence of ignorance.

31:36.440 --> 31:37.830
Gods above,

31:39.150 --> 31:40.910
today, with the power of the Divine Hand,

31:41.790 --> 31:44.110
I sacrifice my life to cleanse the Mortal Realm of sins,

31:45.120 --> 31:48.360
to break the source of all evil,

31:49.040 --> 31:52.410
and to eliminate all sinners!

31:53.480 --> 31:54.270
Begin!

32:33.110 --> 32:34.430
Is it going to rain heavily?

32:36.670 --> 32:37.650
It's not rain.

32:38.270 --> 32:39.310
How is it not?

32:39.820 --> 32:41.100
With all this thunder and lightning,

32:41.220 --> 32:42.590
it's definitely going to pour.

32:43.880 --> 32:45.120
Pay for the wine now

32:45.240 --> 32:46.350
so I can get down the mountain

32:46.370 --> 32:47.760
before I get soaked like a drowned rat.

32:48.840 --> 32:49.560
How much?

32:49.640 --> 32:50.550
One tael and eight maces.

32:51.830 --> 32:52.720
Why is it so expensive?

32:53.000 --> 32:54.070
Eight maces for the wine;

32:54.680 --> 32:56.640
one tael for the trouble of coming up the mountain.

32:58.750 --> 32:59.550
Tomorrow.

32:59.880 --> 33:01.190
I'll pay you tomorrow.

33:01.440 --> 33:02.270
Tomorrow?

33:03.400 --> 33:04.350
You want me to stay here

33:04.350 --> 33:05.400
with you all night?

33:08.000 --> 33:08.790
Isn't it

33:09.240 --> 33:10.790
about to pour anyway?

33:11.310 --> 33:12.110
Look,

33:12.550 --> 33:13.920
the dark clouds are rolling in.

33:13.940 --> 33:16.390
Doesn't it look like a divine punishment from heaven?

33:20.720 --> 33:21.510
My friend,

33:22.160 --> 33:24.510
if we're still alive tomorrow…

33:27.030 --> 33:28.320
I'll pay you.

33:30.440 --> 33:32.130
What nonsense are you talking about?

33:58.550 --> 33:59.350
Yuanzhong.

34:17.480 --> 34:18.510
Help!

34:21.000 --> 34:22.070
Somebody help!

34:23.560 --> 34:25.409
Fire! Fire!

34:37.670 --> 34:40.590
Why are flames falling from the sky?

34:42.110 --> 34:43.800
Mom!

34:45.070 --> 34:46.760
Mom.

34:46.880 --> 34:47.920
Mom.

34:52.320 --> 34:53.550
Oh, heavens!

34:53.880 --> 34:55.280
Spare us!

34:55.280 --> 34:56.840
Spare us!

35:05.000 --> 35:05.800
Yuanzhong,

35:06.590 --> 35:07.840
ask yourself.

35:08.110 --> 35:09.880
After all these years in this world,

35:10.190 --> 35:12.280
apart from hypocrisy, betrayal,

35:12.280 --> 35:13.590
indifference, and obsession,

35:13.960 --> 35:14.760
have you never seen

35:14.760 --> 35:16.280
even a glimmer of goodness?

35:16.710 --> 35:17.920
Is this world truly not worth

35:17.920 --> 35:19.630
a shred of your affection?

35:38.320 --> 35:39.110
Yuanzhong.

35:39.840 --> 35:41.030
I'm your weapon spirit,

35:41.330 --> 35:42.710
closely connected to you,

35:42.710 --> 35:43.630
sharing the same fate.

35:43.920 --> 35:45.030
No matter what you do,

35:45.490 --> 35:47.050
I'll support you.

35:47.670 --> 35:49.110
We exist because of you,

35:49.800 --> 35:51.190
and we perish because of you.

35:51.780 --> 35:52.570
Therefore,

35:53.190 --> 35:54.030
when you hate,

35:54.670 --> 35:55.880
we hate.

35:56.360 --> 35:57.280
When you fear,

35:57.920 --> 35:59.110
we fear.

35:59.340 --> 36:02.140
♫Too many old dreams♫

36:00.070 --> 36:01.070
When you hesitate,

36:01.510 --> 36:02.760
we hesitate.

36:02.620 --> 36:05.630
♫Where did the snow fall to?♫

36:04.280 --> 36:05.230
When you let go,

36:06.070 --> 36:07.320
we let go.

36:06.360 --> 36:10.190
♫Going to face a catastrophe♫

36:07.950 --> 36:09.070
That was my fault.

36:10.200 --> 36:11.550
I failed you.

36:10.590 --> 36:13.410
♫No one is irrelevant♫

36:12.260 --> 36:13.860
Whether you forgive me or not,

36:14.590 --> 36:16.510
I'll always see you as my brother,

36:16.590 --> 36:19.260
♫A slight ripple in my gaze♫

36:16.630 --> 36:17.550
respect you,

36:18.110 --> 36:19.070
and follow you.

36:19.290 --> 36:23.480
♫Who knows the warmth and cold of my fleeting life?♫

36:20.980 --> 36:22.310
I hope that one day

36:23.840 --> 36:25.670
I can make up for my mistake.

36:24.130 --> 36:27.740
♫If staying together is difficult, it's not worth it♫

36:27.190 --> 36:28.670
Do you really have to do this?

36:27.770 --> 36:30.800
♫I'll return what's left of my life♫

36:29.760 --> 36:30.550
Are there

36:31.150 --> 36:32.750
really no other options?

36:31.900 --> 36:33.900
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

36:33.930 --> 36:35.930
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

36:36.410 --> 36:40.400
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

36:37.800 --> 36:38.760
I have sworn

36:38.760 --> 36:39.840
to be with you for life

36:39.960 --> 36:41.400
until you reach

36:40.530 --> 36:43.640
♫If between oaths♫

36:41.400 --> 36:42.440
the end of your days.

36:42.840 --> 36:43.710
I promise

36:43.880 --> 36:45.690
♫I hold onto the longing for just one more glance♫

36:43.920 --> 36:45.360
to accompany you, take care of you,

36:45.360 --> 36:46.800
and protect you

36:45.950 --> 36:49.350
♫Unwilling to bid farewell for good♫

36:46.800 --> 36:47.670
for the rest of your life,

36:47.670 --> 36:48.760
never getting in your way

36:48.760 --> 36:50.590
or doing anything that might harm you.

36:49.520 --> 36:51.520
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

36:50.710 --> 36:51.960
You must not leave me.

36:51.900 --> 36:53.870
♫Longing fades in half♫

36:51.960 --> 36:52.920
No matter where you go,

36:52.920 --> 36:54.000
I will follow you closely,

36:54.000 --> 36:54.760
never leaving your side.

36:54.050 --> 36:57.870
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

36:56.510 --> 36:58.000
I saw your future.

36:59.000 --> 37:05.930
♫A thousand years of long nights, yearning from dawn to dusk♫

36:59.280 --> 37:00.400
In the future,

37:01.440 --> 37:02.630
you'll have gray hair yet still look young.

37:03.150 --> 37:04.360
With your children and grandchildren by your side,

37:05.110 --> 37:06.360
you'll live a peaceful

37:07.110 --> 37:08.230
and happy life.

37:09.710 --> 37:12.630
The one you love will love you too.

37:13.400 --> 37:14.880
Many will envy your life.

37:16.360 --> 37:17.150
In the end,

37:18.070 --> 37:19.480
you'll be happy and fulfilled.

37:20.510 --> 37:22.630
When you look back,

37:22.630 --> 37:24.480
you'll see a life filled with endless happiness.

37:24.520 --> 37:26.520
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

37:26.660 --> 37:28.660
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

37:27.440 --> 37:28.230
