37:35.340 --> 37:37.340
♫The light finally dims♫

37:35.840 --> 37:36.920
So beautiful.

37:37.400 --> 37:41.740
♫How can my heart be at ease?♫

37:41.440 --> 37:43.110
I'm the person who believes in you the most.

37:41.830 --> 37:43.970
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

37:43.710 --> 37:45.360
I'm the one who will

37:43.990 --> 37:45.960
♫Longing fades in half♫

37:45.550 --> 37:47.440
