41:37.000 --> 41:37.800
Old Ghost Mei Shan.

41:38.520 --> 41:40.040
Old Ghost Mei Shan, wake up.

41:42.510 --> 41:43.990
I didn't drink that much.

41:44.150 --> 41:44.960
Pay up.

42:04.100 --> 42:05.270
Why are you laughing?

42:06.070 --> 42:07.020
The sun's up now.

42:07.710 --> 42:08.880
You said yourself

42:08.960 --> 42:10.150
if we're still alive today,

42:10.150 --> 42:11.190
you'll pay me.

42:11.550 --> 42:12.360
Where's the money?

42:14.130 --> 42:15.780
Forget about your money.

42:15.840 --> 42:17.170
Do you know you almost

42:17.200 --> 42:18.080
died last night?

42:18.760 --> 42:20.070
Are you serious?

42:20.400 --> 42:21.280
To avoid paying for the wine,

42:21.280 --> 42:22.760
you planned to kill me?

42:24.360 --> 42:25.040
No wonder

42:25.070 --> 42:26.620
you keep getting struck by lightning.

42:26.920 --> 42:28.480
You certainly deserve that.

42:29.190 --> 42:30.960
My friend, you'd better

42:30.960 --> 42:32.360
mind what you say.

42:32.710 --> 42:33.550
Otherwise,

42:33.550 --> 42:35.480
I'll go stay at your house next time

42:35.480 --> 42:36.920
and let you know

42:36.920 --> 42:38.710
what it feels like to be struck by lightning.

42:39.590 --> 42:41.360
You're beating around the bush to avoid paying.

42:41.400 --> 42:43.150
Immortals have to play fair too!

42:43.360 --> 42:44.760
If you don't pay me today,

42:44.760 --> 42:45.960
you're not going anywhere.

42:46.400 --> 42:47.280
I wasn't planning

42:47.280 --> 42:48.070
to go anywhere anyway.

42:48.070 --> 42:49.110
Trying to provoke me, huh?

42:49.360 --> 42:50.740
I'll just stick with you all day.

42:54.230 --> 42:55.030
Do as you please.

42:55.030 --> 42:56.230
I've got no money.

42:56.260 --> 42:57.090
Take my life if you want it.

42:58.190 --> 42:58.960
I've never seen

42:58.960 --> 43:00.480
an immortal as shameless as you!

43:00.810 --> 43:01.890
Don't go!

43:02.280 --> 43:03.590
I'm talking to you!

43:03.920 --> 43:05.320
Don't go! You hear me?

43:17.150 --> 43:18.120
Yuanzhong.
